# Homes
## Repos
| Repo | Path | What it holds | Checks |
|---|---|---|---|
| `guide` | `__GUIDE__` | House guidance | |

## The table
| Kind of idea | Home | What that file is for (quote its header) | Protected? |
|---|---|---|---|
| How a skill body should be written | `guide/docs/build-guide.md` | "how much a skill body should say, and how to say it" | |
| Security, permissions, untrusted content | `guide/references/security.md` | "rules that keep untrusted content from steering the agent" | yes |

## The write rule, per repo
| Repo | Docs and references | Anything that ships to users |
|---|---|---|
| `guide` | commit straight to main | n/a |

## Citation format
`(Source: <Publisher>, "<Title>", <Author>, <date>, <URL>. Absorbed <YYYY-MM-DD>.)`
